{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a hands-on preview of IT Specialist Simulator! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>In this demo, you\u2019ll experience:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Intro Scene</strong> \u2013 Learn the basics: movement, interactions, hotkeys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388180/extras/2025-05-2220-35-11-ezgif.com-optimize__3_.gif?t=1749152633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Main Scene</strong> \u2013 Step into the IT office and face randomized tech tasks involving computers, networks, and printers. Complete tasks until 10:00 PM for a full day-in-the-life experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Network and sharing center</strong>: The computer needs a network address to work properly. Set it up\u00a0via <strong>NCPA.cpl</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388180/extras/2025-05-2220-35-11-ezgif.com-optimize__2_.gif?t=1749152633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>The Job Market:\u00a0</strong>Explore the in-game job market, finish a short mini-game, and land your first job offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3388180?t=1749152633","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388180/e4f3501ebdd6b643f1157350eaff8ad3125277e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749152633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388180/a9bc